## 3. TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE & INFRASTRUCTURE
* **Web Platform & PWA (Mobile + Desktop):** Next.js (Server-Side Rendering for maximum Google SEO), TypeScript, TailwindCSS—installable on Android/iOS home screens as a Progressive Web App (PWA).
* **Backend & Database:** Node.js + PostgreSQL + Prisma ORM + Redis (for fast search caching and session management).
* **Media Optimization:** Automatic image compression and WebP conversion on Cloudflare R2 to ensure blazing fast loading on Nigerian mobile networks.

### Estimated Monthly Running Costs (Paid Directly to Cloud Providers)
* **Cloud Hosting & Database (Railway / DigitalOcean):** $10 – $20 / month
* **Image & Portfolio Storage (Cloudflare R2):** $0 – $5 / month (Free tier up to 10GB)
* **SMS / OTP Verification (Termii):** Pay-as-you-go (~₦5 per SMS, optional)

